    summary: "The phrase God told me can be used to manipulate or can express sincere conviction. This lesson studies Jeremiah 23:16-32, Deuteronomy 18:20-22 and Proverbs 14:12 to see the seriousness of speaking for God falsely, the harm of manipulation, and healthier language for sharing impressions.",
