    summary: "This session is the final examination week for the Hearing and Discerning the Voice of God course. The examination covers all twenty-four lessons, with emphasis on God's speech in Christ and Scripture, the roles of the Spirit, conscience, counsel and circumstances, testing claims, avoiding careless claims, differing views on prophecy, obedience, silence, community and growth in discernment.",
    scripture: ["Hebrews 1:1-2", "1 Thessalonians 5:21"], more: ["John 10:27", "2 Timothy 3:16-17", "Philippians 1:9-10"], memory: "2 Timothy 3:16-17",
    minutes: 60,
